---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about the Marengo Makers Market, a monthly gathering of local crafters, vendors, and farmers in Marengo, IL.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-14">
    <p class="eyebrow text-ink-soft text-sm">Since 2026 · Marengo, Illinois</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-barn mt-1 mb-6">About the Market</h1>

    <div class="text-ink space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-lg">
        The Marengo Makers Market is a monthly outdoor market bringing together a wide variety of crafters, local vendors, and farmers in the heart of Marengo, Illinois.
      </p>
      <p>
        We gather on Friday evenings from 5:00 to 8:00 PM at Calvin Spencer Park, a welcoming green space at 351 Hale St., just across from the Catholic Church. Each market runs once a month, May through September.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're picking up fresh produce, discovering handmade goods, or just enjoying an evening out with neighbors, the Makers Market is a place to connect with the community and the people who make things here.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-paper-bright rounded-lg p-5 border border-line">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 mb-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7c2214" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="11" r="2.2" />
        </svg>
        <h2 class="eyebrow text-barn text-sm mb-2">Where</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink">Calvin Spencer Park<br />351 Hale St., Marengo, IL<br /><span class="text-ink-soft">Across from the Catholic Church</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-paper-bright rounded-lg p-5 border border-line">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 mb-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7c2214" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
          <path d="M12 7v5l3.2 2" />
        </svg>
        <h2 class="eyebrow text-barn text-sm mb-2">When</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink">Monthly Fridays, May–September<br />5:00 PM – 8:00 PM</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 bg-kraft border border-line rounded-lg p-6">
      <h2 class="eyebrow text-barn text-sm mb-2">Follow along</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink mb-4">Stay up to date on vendor announcements, rain-day calls, and market news.</p>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/marengoilmarket" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-dusk text-paper text-sm font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-dusk-deep transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M24 12.073C24 5.405 18.627 0 12 0S0 5.405 0 12.073C0 18.1 4.388 23.094 10.125 24v-8.437H7.078v-3.49h3.047V9.41c0-3.025 1.792-4.697 4.533-4.697 1.312 0 2.686.236 2.686.236v2.97h-1.513c-1.491 0-1.956.93-1.956 1.884v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.49h-2.796V24C19.612 23.094 24 18.1 24 12.073z"/>
        </svg>
        facebook.com/groups/marengoilmarket
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
